opo\" in VR! This app allows you to work on an imaginary (and nonsense) easy job of placing a flower on sashimis. You can play one-minute \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" mode and eternal \"Infinite Tanpopo\" mode.\n\nBoth touch controllers and hand-tracking are supported. Refresh rate 90Hz is also supported on Oculus Quest 2.", "short_description": "You can experience the Japanese internet meme \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" in VR!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "2867269120154805", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_2867269123488138_3321077611508274240_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=shIV06qNqMEQ7kNvwHp-Cl4&_nc_oc=Adn-pqsY3haxPuPlNZAqT4cA9uRPvHU6b8uFrHt8AjGkXcLzPlwcOHpmK3_TtKMYLec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvNOUbnHf4TxJsNjlB-vBI9X8TpPuQM0b1n14Al1zV_xA&oe=699DB39A"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtMiniLandscape.png", "id": "1673107229564288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974703_1673107236230954_2300899480350089191_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2EmK1sM4mZAQ7kNvwEJ4bIj&_nc_oc=AdmqmpTKhKPSTfWhXgoMWkRJImQp1iW0dsUaWqn_592lLTJWee2nrYwY0o3hoXqfz1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvVKAS6hZIZY1MKqOOv0Qw-IZjmxCfVMjT-VCAusTPjLg&oe=699DA9C7"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "799405117646180", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974454_799405120979513_1375710005646570479_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QdqU1-du5AYQ7kNvwGQgoCC&_nc_oc=AdlUEWomrUSFQrlktDH_ffVY2qONCEFGtgvrSdMCMLVVODa8KaUr2Vs2WatYKkZVOsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuKlpjBcf-nCWrVd9Toqo97j-gWrhlylV4hyzAUUtGrCg&oe=699D8C7C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtSquare.png", "id": "462919248108982", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/